  "title": "Vertiv Launches Chilled Water-Based Prefabricated Modular Data Center Solution to Address Growing Computing Demand in North America",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today introduced Vertiv™ SmartMod™ Max CW, a prefabricated modular data center designed to address the growing demand for rapid deployment of compute. This configurable and scalable solution supports up to 200kW of total IT load in a single system and utilizes chilled water cooling for reduced environmental impact and energy efficiency. The solution is now available in North America.",
